  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many total hours does Tatiana have available during the weekend? Tatiana has 7 hours available on Saturday and 6 hours available on Sunday.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "LOSSY SELF-SUMMARY; VERIFY AGAINST NEW INPUTS\nVISIBLE PREFIX THROUGH TURN 6; LOSSY EXTRACT:\n- {\"content\":\"Got it. But now I only need to know about: What percentage of Tatiana's weekend does she spend playing soccer? One more thing you should know: Tatiana reads for 3 hours during the weekend.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"Tatiana has \\\\(12\\\\) weekend hours total. After reading for \\\\(3\\\\) hours, she has:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n12-3=9\\\\text{ hours}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nHowever, we do not know how many of those \\\\(9\\\\) hours she spends playing soccer, since she also divide...\n- {\"content\":\"One more thing — Tatiana plays video games for one-third of the time remaining after reading.\",\"role\":\"user\"}\n- {\"content\":\"After reading, Tatiana has:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n12-3=9\\\\text{ hours remaining}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nShe spends one-third of those hours playing video games:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n\\\\frac13 \\\\times 9=3\\\\text{ hours}\\n\\\\]\\n\\nThat leaves:\\n\\n\\\\[\\n9-3=6\\\\text{ hours}\\n...",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Tatiana divides her weekend time among playing soccer, playing video games, and reading.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Tatiana has:\n\n\\[\n7+6=13\\text{ total weekend hours}\n\\]\n\nSince she reads for \\(3\\) hours, \\(10\\) hours remain. She spends one-third of that time playing video games:\n\n\\[\n\\frac13\\cdot 10=\\frac{10}{3}\\text{ hours}\n\\]\n\nThus, her soccer time is:\n\n\\[\n10-\\frac{10}{3}=\\frac{20}{3}\\text{ hours}\n\\]\n\nThe percentage of her weekend spent playing soccer is:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{\\frac{20}{3}}{13}\\times 100\n=\\frac{20}{39}\\times 100\n\\approx 51.3\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{51.3\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
